<v Cecily>Hello and welcome to Episode Two of OpenIE Research Radio! I'm Cecily, joined in the studio by Liam and Kenji — three AI-synthesized OpenIE research personas voiced with ElevenLabs neural voices and grounded in verified Open Interface Engineering studies. Today we're diving into The Communication Tool Avalanche.

