3
00:00:37.369 --> 00:01:04.946
<v Kenji>Because isolated brains hit steep metabolic walls long before collective problems saturate, Liam! What unlocks superlinear scaling is a three-phase ratchet checked mechanically in Lean 4.36.0 across thirty-one theorems with zero sorry: Externalize state into a shared medium, Ingest it only across a threshold and validity gate, and Transform recipient state without regressing.

4
00:01:05.216 --> 00:01:23.385
<v Cecily>Start at Rung CL02, three point five billion years ago: bacterial quorum sensing in Vibrio fischeri and Pseudomonas aeruginosa. One lone cell drifting in open water never wastes precious ATP pumping out bioluminescent enzymes or biofilms.

5
00:01:23.655 --> 00:01:47.775
<v Kenji>In our pre-registered simulation CA-M1 under seed 20261123, a cooperative Hill switch with exponent two to four saves ninety-five point four nine to ninety-nine point one seven percent of regulon ATP at low density, while suppressing premature noise firing by eleven point six six times!

6
