15
00:04:39.672 --> 00:05:12.622
<v Kenji>Rust BLAKE3 plus Ed25519 envelope verification takes twenty-five point nine five to thirty-seven point three nine microseconds — just six hundred forty-three to nine hundred twenty-six microjoules per edge! Zero-clock Linux eventfd waiting cuts one-percent-duty socket energy by two point two one times versus one-kilohertz polling, and min-cost flow reroutes around two hundred out of two hundred Byzantine faults in two point four microseconds.

16
00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:36.154
<v Liam>And once a frontier fifteen-joule model solves a novel bug and clears the test gate, downward crystallization locks that fix into a one-point-seven-seven microjoule lookup case — matching our twenty-generation cultural ratchet CA-M5, where attested libraries held one hundred percent competence after synthetic teachers left, while unverified imitation dropped to twenty-nine percent!

